{"data":{"body":"[P2] For a visible non-`DurableSampler` replacement, this invokes `shouldSample` once to seed ancestor flags, but the result is intentionally not carried to the real SDK spans, so their sampler runs again. Stateful or rate-limited samplers consume an extra decision per invocation and can sample a different set of spans than their normal per-span policy. Avoid the preflight call for plain replacements or make its result the actual span decision; add a direct stateful-sampler call-count test.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc774-ET","finding_digest":"4817f8f1a3bdbef06e7387a0c3d68ff75375b61b6f611c683891900194b4c061","finding_id":"arf_v1_jal7r4ndxw7pa3ttq6qmhvup65","finding_key":"otel-plugin/otelpluginsupport::resolvesamplingresult::visible-replacement-preflight-sampling","identity_key":"otel-plugin/otelpluginsupport::resolvesamplingresult::visible-replacement-preflight-sampling","line":169,"observation_digest":"11933784b6ace7613b373f22e4014b9a4205aa78d08fd6779641e8cef48eb616","observation_id":"aro_v1_cgjtpbfwvttwcozxh4roiakltj","path":"otel-plugin/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/otel/OtelPluginSupport.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-10-09T02:20:28Z","review_id":"arr_v1_hyhhujz5d345gd5gjgv3rog337","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"c59039a8be52bf63f76d100110e28cd66d4ec510","reviewer":"codex","start_line":168,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":769},"record_id":"art_v1_dxcvuexduauaelyfcf5voqf5dx","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-09T02:20:28Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
